Cell["Abstract", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978187910540496*^9, 
  3.978187912278749*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33c3f0d0-1171-43a6-90a0-\
b3cbb8c245b9"],

Cell["\<\
In this notebook, we derive the Schwarzschild metric for the spacetime \
geometry in the vicinity of a black hole. The derivation is standard, but the \
novel contribution here  is advancement of the \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] calculus, moving its compiler from proof-of-concept to \
prototype.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.977513712847348*^9, {3.9775178669407883`*^9, 3.977517959906126*^9}, {
   3.977517996418476*^9, 3.977518072452635*^9}, {3.9775181219359083`*^9, 
   3.977518224156801*^9}, {3.9775359524035*^9, 3.977536075585163*^9}, {
   3.97753737910937*^9, 3.977537384309*^9}, {3.97764405920399*^9, 
   3.977644347525126*^9}, {3.977672253563974*^9, 3.977672266570442*^9}, {
   3.977678754525832*^9, 3.977678800149303*^9}, {3.977746420549296*^9, 
   3.977746648340251*^9}, {3.977915629794395*^9, 3.9779156364877872`*^9}, {
   3.977915706330698*^9, 3.977915719172121*^9}, {3.9781876022023067`*^9, 
   3.978187616921665*^9}, {3.978187782697919*^9, 3.978187820554805*^9}, {
   3.9781879304464903`*^9, 3.978187931982128*^9}, {3.978222249151208*^9, 
   3.978222378998098*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"82ee9929-ed00-4b27-92ab-\
af3c1e2fdfea"],

Cell["\<\
The \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] calculus automates symbolic operations \
such as covariant differentiation, tensor quotienting,  canonicalizing \
indices, etc. The \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] compiler translates \
between index notations in \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] and component \
representations in Wolfram arrays. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.977513712847348*^9, {3.9775178669407883`*^9, 3.977517959906126*^9}, {
   3.977517996418476*^9, 3.977518072452635*^9}, {3.9775181219359083`*^9, 
   3.977518224156801*^9}, {3.9775359524035*^9, 3.977536075585163*^9}, {
   3.97753737910937*^9, 3.977537384309*^9}, {3.97764405920399*^9, 
