Cell["\<\
Now that we\[CloseCurlyQuote]re happy with a reduction strategy, apply it to \
all components of \[CapitalGamma] in a new 3D matrix, one dimension for each \
index:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9781943168406982`*^9, 3.978194357881051*^9}, {
