  3.978223492684713*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c680aedf-317a-4c37-8348-\
f8e67a732149"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this weak-field limit, it is a standard result (not derived in this \
notebook) that the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"t", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "753e2861-3d0a-4394-ab17-8e4209367a41"],
 " component of the metric, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["g", 
    RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"t", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "t"}]}]], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"0fa31221-e75e-456b-85a7-30dc5fc7f70e"],
 ", be directly related to the Newtonian gravitational potential \
\[CapitalPhi]:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978095708351858*^9, 3.978095719850621*^9}, {
  3.978220413042335*^9, 3.978220522498579*^9}, {3.978221081886423*^9, 
  3.978221168216464*^9}, {3.978221223050321*^9, 3.978221224569928*^9}, {
